<title>USA: Campbell to buy 13.5 mln shares at $80/shr.</title>
<headline>Campbell to buy 13.5 mln shares at $80/shr.</headline>
<dateline>CAMDEN, N.J. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Campbell Soup Co said Friday that it will buy 13,519,906 shares of its stock at $80 per share in accordance with a tender offer completed October 10.</p>
<p>The shares represent about 5.5 percent of 247 million Campbell shares outstanding, the company said.</p>
<p>Campbell began the tender offer September 12 with the intention of buying up to 18 million shares for $69 to $80 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
